  "description": "Makita ADML815 Outdoor Adventure™ 18V LXT® L.E.D. Flashlight - Distributed/Packaged by Makita. Product Details: Makita ADML815 Outdoor Adventure™ 18V LXT® L.E.D. Flashlight - Distributed/Packaged by Makita. Product Details: Makita ADML815 Outdoor Adventure™ 18V LXT® L.E.D. Flashlight - Distributed/Packaged by Makita. Product Details: Get outside with Outdoor Adventure, a new series of cordless products that operate within the LXT® system. Outdoor Adventure Products feature advanced technology, delivering maximum performance and efficiency for the outdoors. Makita offers hundreds of products within the 18V LXT® system so you can create your own adventure.Light up the outdoors with the Outdoor Adventure™ 18V LXT® L.E.D. Flashlight (ADML815). The high-luminance 4 L.E.D. flashlight provides 160 lumens. The fast-charging Makita® 18V LXT® Lithium-Ion Battery delivers up to 23 hours of continuous illumination on a single charge (when using the 18V LXT® Lithium-Ion 5.0Ah battery, sold separately). The 12-position aluminum pivoting head provides added versatility.It’s part of Makita’s expanding 18V Lithium-Ion System, the world’s largest cordless tool system powered by 18V lithium-ion slide-style batteries. Makita 18V LXT® Lithium-Ion Batteries have the fastest charge times in their categories, so they spend more time working and less time sitting on the charger.",
